'''Cat Machine''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]], [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] increases health, range, attack rate and movement speed and replaces [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]] with [[Wave Shield]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

